```text
  Before Java 8:                    After Java 8:
  ─────────────────                 ─────────────────
  interface Iterable<T> {           interface Iterable<T> {
      Iterator<T> iterator();           Iterator<T> iterator();
      // Adding forEach() breaks       default void forEach(Consumer c) {
      // ALL implementations!               for (T t : this) c.accept(t);
  }                                     }
                                    }
  ArrayList: must add forEach()     ArrayList: gets forEach() FREE
  LinkedList: must add forEach()    LinkedList: gets forEach() FREE
  HashSet: must add forEach()       HashSet: gets forEach() FREE
  ... millions more                 ... zero changes needed
```

```text
  Default vs Static:
  ┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐
  │ Default Method   │    │ Static Method    │
  │ inherited: YES   │    │ inherited: NO    │
  │ overridable: YES │    │ overridable: NO  │
  │ instance.method()│    │ Interface.method()│
  └─────────────────┘    └─────────────────┘
```
